{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08966","headline":"大梁亭会李四栖梧作 · 韦应物","name":"大梁亭会李四栖梧作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁王昔爱才，千古化不泯。\n至今蓬池上，远集八方宾。\n车马平明合，城郭满埃尘。\n逢君一相许，岂要平生亲。\n入仕三十载，如何独未伸。\n英声久籍籍，台阁多故人。\n置酒发清弹，相与乐佳辰。\n孤亭得长望，白日下广津。\n富贵良可取，朅来西入秦。\n秋风旦夕起，安得客梁陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}